Fix SNP calling, query error handling, workdir handling and reference loading

- ParseXMFA: SNP call condition 'or' -> 'and', gap/N no longer counted as other base (#43)
- DatabaseConnection.query: UNIQUE-constraint error object is no longer returned on paths where callers chain fetch* calls (#55)
- CanSNPer2.run: removed os.chdir, tmp/log/out/ref dirs resolved against workdir; print_summary now checks create_tree return before unpacking (#2, #7)
- DownloadGenomes: symlink path built with os.path.join (no chdir), ValueError when no database, mkdir via os.makedirs (#8, #45, #46)
- ModifyDatabase: load_genome_reference_file completed, opens the reference_file argument and adds each row to snp_references, keeping ids in self.genomes; add_genome inserts via self.taxonomydb (#25, #42)
